NAME
    del - Permanently delete one or more explicitly named files. Directories are not removed by del.

SYNOPSIS
    del <file_name> [file_name ...]

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Permanently delete one or more explicitly named files. Directories are not removed by del.

FAT NAME SUPPORT
    The current Inu FAT provider creates and renames entries using FAT 8.3 short names.
    Long-file-name creation and rename are reserved for a later filesystem-provider extension.

NOTES
    Wildcards are not expanded in 0.37.0; provide each file name explicitly.

EXAMPLES
    del OLD.TXT
    del A.TXT B.TXT C.TXT

FILES
    /System/Commands/DEL.CMD
    /INU/HELP/DEL.MAN
